  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-14T17:19:18.452Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I’ve been asking around for about a year now, but I’ve come to the conclusion there is just no way to disable turning assistance with your head position in VR. When I’m playing Magic Freeze Tag, or something, and I want to quickly look in another direction, it turns slightly in the direction I’m looking, so I need to compensate with a new angle on the thumbstick, which is inaccurate and leads to frustration. All you need is an option to toggle on and off head turning. I understand it’s a feature for our convenience and assistance, but having stuck on without changing it can often ruin what would make an otherwise good VR experience. Thank you",
